{#-
  An invitation to assess a competency in somebody's clinician passport.
  The recipient may never have heard of Quill, so it says who is asking,
  what they are asked to do and how long the link lasts, in that order.
  Never a patient, a procedure performed on anyone, or any clinical detail
  of the evidence. Context:
    assessor_name    who is being invited, as the holder gave it
    holder_name      the clinician asking to be assessed
    competency_name  what they want signed off, or None when the
                     invitation comes before the request
    url              the accept link
    expires_in_days  how long the link lasts
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}
{%- if competency_name %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to assess a competency
{%- else %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to be an assessor{% endif -%}
{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}
{%- if competency_name %}{{ competency_name }}, recorded in their clinician passport.
{%- else %}Recording outcomes in their clinician passport.{% endif -%}
{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{% if competency_name %}
{{ c.heading("You have been asked to assess a *competency*") }}
{% else %}
{{ c.heading("You have been asked to be an *assessor*") }}
{% endif %}
{{ c.paragraph("Dear " ~ assessor_name ~ ",") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}
{%- if competency_name %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to assess <strong>{{ competency_name }}</strong> and record the outcome in their clinician passport.
{%- else %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to act as an assessor and record outcomes in their clinician passport.{% endif -%}
{% endcall %}
{% call c.panel() %}
{{ c.paragraph("A clinician passport is a record of competencies a clinician has been assessed as able to perform, signed by the person who assessed them.") }}
<p style="margin: 0">You will be asked to confirm your professional registration before you sign anything.</p>
{% endcall %}
{{ c.button("Accept the invitation", url) }}
{{ c.small("You can use this link until you accept the invitation. It expires in " ~ expires_in_days ~ " days.") }}
{{ c.small("If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email and nothing will happen.") }}
{% endblock %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because {{ holder_name }} entered this address when inviting an assessor on Quill.{% endblock %}
{% block text %}
Dear {{ assessor_name }},

{% if competency_name %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to assess {{ competency_name }} and record the outcome in their clinician passport.{% else %}{{ holder_name }} has asked you to act as an assessor and record outcomes in their clinician passport.{% endif %}

A clinician passport is a record of competencies a clinician has been assessed as able to perform, signed by the person who assessed them. You will be asked to confirm your professional registration before you sign anything.

Accept the invitation: {{ url }}

You can use this link until you accept the invitation. It expires in {{ expires_in_days }} days.

If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email and nothing will happen.
{% endblock %}
